<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets 200 bln lire seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets 200 bln lire seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager IMI Lux and BNL.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN LIRE  COUPON    *7.30	MATURITY    01.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE   STRAIGHT	ISS PRICE  101.55    PAY DATE    01.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR YEARS ONE AND TWO THEN EXHCHANGEABLE INTO AN</p>
<p>		FRN ISSUE PAYING 6M LIBOR +15 BP.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMS US/UK/DE/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
